    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK GROUP ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you….\r\n\r\n4 / 5 BED 2 BATH DETACHED HOME \r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER MATURE DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES \r\nSOUTH EAST FACING BACK GARDEN \r\nMOST IDYLLIC CUL DE SAC POSITION \r\n\r\nMichael Dunne The Swords Property Specialist is truly delighted to present No. 19 Drynam Court to the Swords property market. Houses are rare to come to market in this sleepy, mature area and the position of No. 19 is sure to attract strong interest from families and parties trading up alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 19 is presented to market in excellent condition.\r\n\r\nThe extra spacious accommodation consists of: Entrance porch, hall, guest bathroom, living room, kitchen / room & study / bedroom 5.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms to include primary & family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe features of this home include: Feature fireplace in living room, quality fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage. The bathrooms benefit from quality tiling and sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a garden and private driveway to the front. To the rear is a good sized lawned garden with a south easterly aspect.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary & secondary schools. \r\nSwords Village & The Pavilions Shopping Centre are literally on your doorstep. Malahide and the coast are within a short drive.\r\n\r\nThe area is serviced by an excellent bus route including the Swords Express.\r\n\r\nDublin International Airport, The M50 & M1 Motorways are also close by.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
